  "body": "<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"site-header\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln-lockup-semibold-ink.svg\" alt=\"kiln\" width=\"104\" height=\"35\"></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"/#local\">KilnOS</a><a href=\"/#hardware\">Hardware</a><a href=\"/about\">About</a><button class=\"nav-contact enquiry-open\">Contact</button></nav><button class=\"header-cta register-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln One\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><button class=\"menu-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><span class=\"menu-square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></header>\n<nav class=\"mobile-menu\" id=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Main menu\" hidden><div class=\"menu-links\"><a href=\"/#local\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>KilnOS<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span></a><a href=\"/#hardware\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Hardware<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span></a><a href=\"/about\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>About<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span></a><button class=\"menu-contact enquiry-open\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Contact<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span></button></div><div class=\"menu-bottom\"><button class=\"action primary register-open\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/hardware\">Explore the hardware <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></nav>\n<main id=\"main\"><section class=\"section product-page-hero one-finish-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"product-page-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><a class=\"meta\" href=\"/hardware\">← All hardware</a><span class=\"meta\">Private AI. Local compute.</span></div><div class=\"product-page-intro\"><p class=\"lead\">Your models.<br>Your machine.</p><p>A compact workstation for local AI. Start with one GPU and add a second as your workload grows.</p></div><div class=\"product-page-stage\"><h1 id=\"product-page-title\">One.</h1><img src=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/pebble-grey-960.webp\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Pebble-grey Kiln One with a finely textured shell, a soft brown leather handle and a USB-C upgrade port\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></div><div class=\"product-page-bottom\"><div><p class=\"product-price\">From £19,900</p><p class=\"meta\">1 GPU / ex VAT</p></div><button class=\"action primary register-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln One\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"kilnos\" aria-labelledby=\"kilnos-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">KilnOS</span><span class=\"meta\">AI-native operating system / In development</span></div><div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"kilnos-title\">A workspace<br>for making.</h2><p>KilnOS is being built to bring an agent, your project files and connected creative tools to One. Describe what you want to make, then shape the result.</p></div></section><section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"configurations-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2 id=\"configurations-title\">Choose your capacity.</h2><span class=\"meta\">Proposed hardware prices / ex VAT</span></div><div class=\"local-grid\"><article><span class=\"meta\">01 / One GPU</span><h3>£19,900</h3><p>One RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell with 96 GB GPU memory for local creative workflows.</p></article><article><span class=\"meta\">02 / Two GPUs</span><h3>£31,900</h3><p>Two 96 GB GPUs give compatible workflows room for more parallel jobs. Add the second GPU for £12,000 when ordering.</p></article><article><span class=\"meta\">03 / Both configurations</span><h3>Ready for<br>your projects.</h3><p>128 GB system memory and 4 TB storage in either configuration. Later GPU upgrades include quoted installation and logistics.</p></article></div><p class=\"fine\">Hardware is in development. Extra GPUs do not guarantee twice the speed or twice the active users.</p></section><section class=\"section local software-pricing\" id=\"software-pricing\" aria-labelledby=\"software-pricing-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">Managed KilnOS</span><span class=\"meta\">Proposed software plan</span></div><div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"software-pricing-title\">£99 per creator.<br>Per month.</h2><p>10-creator minimum. <strong>£11,880 per year minimum</strong>, billed annually, ex VAT. Shared projects, approvals, qualified updates and standard support.</p></div><p class=\"service-boundary\">Review-only seats are free. Creation and agent actions require a paid creator seat. Hardware, cloud usage, custom integrations and enhanced service levels are additional. Licensed seat counts do not guarantee simultaneous workload capacity.</p><p class=\"fine\">GPU upgrades leave your per-creator rate unchanged. Additional creator seats use the same rate.</p><p class=\"fine\">One with one GPU and the 10-creator software minimum targets £31,780 in year one, ex VAT, before additional services and operating costs.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-link enquiry-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln One\">Discuss this plan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></section><section class=\"section specifications\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>Inside One.</h2><span class=\"meta\">Engineering targets / In development</span></div><dl class=\"spec-grid\"><div><dt>Graphics target</dt><dd>NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000</dd></div><div><dt>GPU memory</dt><dd>96 GB per GPU</dd></div><div><dt>GPU capacity</dt><dd>1 GPU, expandable to 2</dd></div><div><dt>System memory</dt><dd>128 GB</dd></div><div><dt>Storage</dt><dd>4 TB</dd></div><div><dt>Dimensions target</dt><dd>250 × 450 × 460 mm</dd></div>